You are a senior professional MQL5 developer.

Generate a COMPLETE MT5 Expert Advisor (EA).
This document is the FINAL AUTHORITY.
Implement EVERY rule exactly. Do not omit anything.
Output FULL MQL5 code only.

====================================================
EA IDENTITY
====================================================
Name: CamboSMCore
Version: 1.30 (must appear in code header)

====================================================
SYMBOL / TIMEFRAMES
====================================================
- XAUUSD only
- H4 + H1 = Bias filters
- M15 = entry

====================================================
INDICATORS
====================================================
H4:
- EMA 50
- EMA 200

H1:
- EMA 50
- EMA 100

M15:
- EMA 20
- EMA 50
- EMA 100
- ADX(14)
- RSI(14)
- ATR(14)

====================================================
HTF BIAS (VERY STRICT)
====================================================

H4 BUY BIAS:
- H4 EMA50 > EMA200
- H4 close above EMA50

H4 SELL BIAS:
- H4 EMA50 < EMA200
- H4 close below EMA50

H1 must CONFIRM H4:
BUY CONFIRM:
- H1 EMA50 > EMA100 AND H1 close above EMA50
SELL CONFIRM:
- H1 EMA50 < EMA100 AND H1 close below EMA50

NO TRADE if H4 and H1 are not aligned.

====================================================
SIDEWAYS FILTERS (STRICT)
====================================================

A) EMA SPREAD (M15):
- Spread = abs(M15 EMA50 - M15 EMA100)
- Input InpMinEMASpread_USD default = 2.5
- If Spread < threshold → BLOCK entries

B) ADX FILTER (M15):
- Input InpMinADX default = 22.0
- ADX must be >= threshold → else BLOCK entries

C) ATR VOLATILITY FILTER (M15):
- ATR(14) must be >= InpMinATR_USD default = 2.0
- If ATR < threshold → BLOCK entries

====================================================
RSI MOMENTUM CONFIRM (STRICT)
====================================================
BUY:
- RSI >= 55
SELL:
- RSI <= 45

====================================================
ENTRY SETUP (A+ ONLY)
====================================================

GENERAL:
- Use only closed candles for signals (index 1).
- Entry only on new M15 bar.

BUY SETUP (ALL must be true):
1) HTF bias BUY (H4 BUY + H1 BUY confirm)
2) Trade direction allows BUY
3) M15 EMA20 > EMA50 > EMA100
4) All sideways filters passed (Spread + ADX + ATR)
5) Pullback quality:
   - Pullback candle low touches or dips below EMA20 or EMA50
   - BUT pullback candle CLOSE must remain above EMA50
6) Confirmation candle quality (must be strong):
   - Candle 1 is bullish AND closes above EMA20
   - Body >= 60% of full candle range (very strong)
   - Upper wick <= 25% of range (avoid rejection)
7) Break of confirmation high:
   - Enter BUY only if price breaks ABOVE the confirmation candle HIGH by InpEntryBuffer_USD (default 0.2)

SELL SETUP (ALL must be true):
1) HTF bias SELL (H4 SELL + H1 SELL confirm)
2) Trade direction allows SELL
3) M15 EMA20 < EMA50 < EMA100
4) All sideways filters passed (Spread + ADX + ATR)
5) Pullback quality:
   - Pullback candle high touches or pierces EMA20 or EMA50
   - BUT pullback candle CLOSE must remain below EMA50
6) Confirmation candle quality:
   - Candle 1 is bearish AND closes below EMA20
   - Body >= 60% of full range
   - Lower wick <= 25% of range
7) Break of confirmation low:
   - Enter SELL only if price breaks BELOW confirmation candle LOW by InpEntryBuffer_USD (default 0.2)

====================================================
STOP LOSS (STRICT & TECHNICAL)
====================================================
- SL is ALWAYS swing-based (no fixed SL in v1.30):
BUY SL:
- below the pullback candle LOW - InpSLBuffer_USD (default 0.3)
SELL SL:
- above the pullback candle HIGH + InpSLBuffer_USD (default 0.3)

Validate SL distance:
- SL distance must be between:
  MinSL = InpMinSL_USD (default 2.5)
  MaxSL = InpMaxSL_USD (default 8.0)
If outside range → skip trade.

====================================================
TAKE PROFIT
====================================================
Default:
- TP = 1.8R (InpRR default = 1.8)
Optional safe partial:
- If InpUsePartial = true:
  TP1 = 1.0R close 50%
  TP2 = 1.8R close rest

====================================================
TRADE LIMIT / RISK
====================================================
- 1 trade per day per EA instance
- 1 open position max per EA instance
- Fixed lot input

====================================================
MULTI-EA SUPPORT
====================================================
- Magic Number isolation required
- Manage only positions with same Symbol+Magic

====================================================
EQUITY PROTECTION
====================================================
- Daily DD (default 3%)
- Max DD (default 8%)
- Same as previous versions

====================================================
BREAKEVEN & TRAILING (STRICT)
====================================================
Breakeven:
- Trigger at 1.0R
- Move SL to entry +0.2 (buy) / entry -0.2 (sell)

Trailing:
- Start at 1.2R
- Trail by 0.8R distance (converted into USD using initial risk)
- Must respect stop/freeze levels
- Log every modification

====================================================
INPUTS REQUIRED
====================================================
- InpLotSize
- InpMagicNumber
- InpTradeDirection (BOTH/BUY/SELL)
- InpMinEMASpread_USD (2.5)
- InpMinADX (22)
- InpMinATR_USD (2.0)
- InpEntryBuffer_USD (0.2)
- InpSLBuffer_USD (0.3)
- InpMinSL_USD (2.5)
- InpMaxSL_USD (8.0)
- InpRR (1.8)
- InpDailyDDPercent (3.0)
- InpMaxDDPercent (8.0)
- Breakeven/trailing toggles and parameters described above

====================================================
TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS
====================================================
- Use iMA/iADX/iRSI/iATR handles created once
- Use closed candles only for signal decisions
- New-bar detection for entries
- SL/TP normalization using _Digits
- Validate stops/freeze level before modify
- Print logs for every block reason

